<title>BELGIUM: EU reviews Swiss Re control of French reinsurer.</title>
<headline>EU reviews Swiss Re control of French reinsurer.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had started a routine probe into the takeover of French reinsurance firm Societe Anonyme Francaise de Reassurances (SAFR) by Schweizerische Rueckversicherungs (Swiss Re).</p>
<p>It said in a notice published in the Official Journal C84 that the deal was submitted for clearance on March 7 under the merger regulation which bans creation or strengthening of dominant positions.</p>
<p>The Commission has one month from that date to clear the operation or start a full probe.</p>
</text>
